1
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:07,260
Come on,no peeking.
不能偷看喔

2
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:11,370
Our eyes are closed,and we're crossing the street. Very good.
我們要閉眼睛過馬路，太好了

3
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:13,400
Okay. Open up!
好，可以看了

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,410
What do you want to show us?
你們是要我們看什麼？

5
00:00:19,430 --> 00:00:22,580
Because all I can see is this bitchen van!
我只看到…超炫的廂型車！

6
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:26,250
It's for our catering business.
這是我們做外燴的專用車

7
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,750
I think I know that girl.
我好像認識那女孩

8
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,590
We won't keep it this way,though.
但最後不會是這樣 不會嗎？

9
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:36,860
We'll replace the sword with a baguette.
我們會把寶刀換成法國麵包

10
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:41,630
Oh,my God,I think I lost my virginity in that van.
天啊，我的第一次 好像就是在廂型車裡

11
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,640
Also,we don't know what to do with this.
還有這個也不知道要怎麼處理

12
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,640
Oh yeah,I definitely know her.
對，我一定認識她

13
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,910
The One Where They're Going To Party!
本集播出：「狂歡之王」

00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,910
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:38,730 --> 00:01:42,290
Remember that guy from cooking school that put cilantro in everything?
還記得我說過那個在烹飪學校 煮什麼都加香菜的人嗎？

15
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,330
Sure,Cilantro Larry!
記得，香菜賴瑞嘛

16
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:49,460
I'm filling in for him as food critic for the Chelsea Reporter.
我要替他代班 幫赤爾夕通訊報做美食評鑒

17
00:01:49,670 --> 00:01:53,070
What an amazing opportunity to influence...
摩妮卡，這可是大好機會呢 你能影響到…

18
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,270
...dozens of people!
二、三十個人呢

19
00:01:57,950 --> 00:02:00,140
What about our catering business?
那我們的外燴生意怎麼辦？

20
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:02,080
It's just one night a week.
我這個一星期只要一個晚上

21
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,950
Plus,I get to take you out for free dinners.
我還能帶你們到處去吃免錢的

22
00:02:06,490 --> 00:02:08,920
Well,in that case....
既然是那樣的話…

23
00:02:11,660 --> 00:02:13,920
That was me,hopping on board.
剛才是我在上車一起去

24
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,630
Hey,guys. Hey,Ross!
大夥兒好，羅斯？

25
00:02:16,830 --> 00:02:18,490
Quick question for you.
快問快答

26
00:02:19,170 --> 00:02:20,630
Are you ready to party?
你準備好要狂歡沒？

27
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:25,200
I could maybe go out for a couple of beers.
沒有，出去喝幾杯啤酒或許行

28
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:28,870
There's this thing about bees on the Discovery Channel.
但是今晚發現頻道要演大黃蜂

29
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:32,710
I don't think you heard me. Are you ready...
你可能沒聽清楚 你準備好要…

30
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:34,210
...to party?
狂歡沒？

31
00:02:35,550 --> 00:02:37,210
No.
不會吧

32
00:02:37,690 --> 00:02:39,810
Gandalf? Gandalf is coming to town?
甘道夫要來？

33
00:02:40,050 --> 00:02:44,650
I have nothing to do,so tomorrow we are partying with Gandalf,dude!
兄弟，反正我女友不在沒事幹 明天我們去跟甘道夫狂歡吧！

34
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:48,630
Dude,we are so going to party!
兄弟，我們要去狂歡了耶

35
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,660
Wow,okay. Dude alert!
好吧，兄弟請注意

36
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:55,100
Who is this guy?
這個人是誰？

37
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:59,600
Mike "Gandalf" Ganderson. Only the funnest guy in the world.
麥克甘道夫 世界上最爆笑的人

38
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,870
I'll call to get off work tomorrow.
我要打給公司說明天請假

39
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:04,010
I'll call after you!
你打完換我

40
00:03:04,850 --> 00:03:07,780
This will be so cool! We never party anymore.
兄弟，這一定超酷的 我們八百年沒狂歡了

41
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:14,150
Were you smoking something in the back of our van?
你們是不是躲在廂型車裡 偷抽了大麻？

42
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:18,420
"We never have fun anymore"? You have fun with me.
是啊，什麼叫八百年沒狂歡 跟我在一起就很樂啊

43
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:22,790
Remember those strippers? And you paid me $50 to eat that book?
記得去看脫衣舞那回？ 你們給我50美元要我吞書

44
00:03:24,930 --> 00:03:29,030
You are going to love this guy. Gandalf is the party wizard.
喬伊，這個人你一定喜歡 甘道夫是狂歡巫師喔

45
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,070
Why do you call him "Gandalf"?
你們幹嘛叫他「甘道夫」？

46
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:32,960
Gandalf the Wizard.
巫師甘道夫啊

47
00:03:34,780 --> 00:03:38,710
Didn't you read Lord of the Rings in high school?
你念高中沒看過「魔戒」？

48
00:03:39,050 --> 00:03:41,380
No,I had sex in high school.
沒，但我念高中有上過床

49
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:51,450
Joanna? I was wondering if I could ask you something.
喬安娜，有件事想請問一下

50
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:54,750
There's an opening for a buyer in Junior Miss
少淑女服飾的採購助理有空缺

51
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:59,160
-That'd be a step down for me. -Actually,I meant for me.
那我豈不是連降三級了？ 不是啦，我是毛遂自薦

53
00:03:59,830 --> 00:04:02,830
The hiring committee is meeting people all day and....
招聘委員會每天都在面試…

54
00:04:03,770 --> 00:04:07,040
I guess you can't stay my assistant forever.
我很希望我能拒絕 但總不能讓你永遠當我助理吧

55
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:10,440
Neither can you,Sophie, but for different reasons.
蘇菲，你也是，但理由不同

56
00:04:12,010 --> 00:04:16,540
I'm so glad you don't have a problem. If you did,I wouldn't apply.
真高興你完全沒有意見 否則我壓根不會想去報考

57
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:17,740
In that case
真的啊，那樣的話…

58
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:20,110
That's why I'm glad there's no problem.
所以我才很高興你沒意見

59
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:24,750
I'm on the hiring committee, so there'll be one friendly face.
沒關係，其實我也是面試人員 你起碼能看到一張友善的臉

60
00:04:24,990 --> 00:04:26,390
That's great!
這真是太棒了

61
00:04:26,590 --> 00:04:29,120
Junior Miss is where I started.
我也是從少淑女部起家的

62
00:04:29,330 --> 00:04:32,390
I slept with the ugliest guy to get that job.
跟個一級醜男上床 才得到那份工作

63
00:04:33,670 --> 00:04:37,000
-Really? -No.
這樣啊？ 開玩笑的啦

65
00:04:37,170 --> 00:04:39,110
Yeah.
有

66
00:04:39,970 --> 00:04:41,340
I mean,no.
話說回來…沒有啦

67
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:46,250
With your qualifications,you won't need to sleep with some guy.
別擔心，以你的資歷 不用出賣肉體也能被錄取

68
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:50,310
Although I might need some convincing.
雖然我可能要驗貨確定一下

69
00:04:52,490 --> 00:04:53,680
Kidding!
逗你的啦

70
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,190
God,I feel wild today!
天啊，我今天真亢奮

71
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,420
Man,I am so excited, I may vomit.
要命，我興奮到都快吐了

72
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:11,630
Will you calm down? He's just a human guy.
你興奮個什麼勁？ 他不過就是個人嘛

73
00:05:12,110 --> 00:05:14,170
You don't understand. He's amazing.
你有所不知，甘道夫超神的

74
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:16,340
You never know what'll happen.
跟他出去可是驚喜連連

75
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:20,780
You go out for beer and end up on a boat to Nova Scotia.
幾杯啤酒下肚 醒來竟然正在坐漁船去加拿大

76
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:23,710
-Really? -It's beautiful country up there.
真的？ 對，那裡風景很美

77
00:05:24,350 --> 00:05:26,180
Hey. Okay.
好

78
00:05:26,390 --> 00:05:30,720
I got my passport,fresh socks, and a snakebite kit.
我帶了護照，乾淨的襪子 還有蛇毒解藥

79
00:05:31,890 --> 00:05:34,020
It won't be exactly like last time.
這次不會跟上次完全一樣啦

80
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:37,460
I'll see you guys.
回頭見了

82
00:05:40,470 --> 00:05:42,830
I have an audition, but I'll meet you.
我要先去試鏡 晚點一定去跟你們會合

83
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,830
Where will you be around noon?
你們中午左右會在哪裡？

84
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:47,970
Somewhere maybe along the equator?
差不多在赤道附近吧

85
00:05:49,482 --> 00:05:50,949
好

86
00:05:53,150 --> 00:05:54,640
Hello.

87
00:05:54,820 --> 00:05:56,040
It's Gandalf!
甘道夫打來的！

88
00:05:58,890 --> 00:06:00,410
So are you in town?
你已經到了？

89
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:04,560
Oh,well....

90
00:06:04,730 --> 00:06:07,190
Maybe next time,then.
那就下次再約吧

91
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,980
What happened?
怎麼了？

92
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,260
He can't come. He's stuck in Chicago.
他在芝加哥耽擱，沒辦法來

93
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:12,690
Oh,man!
要命

94
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:15,560
Chicago's so lucky.
芝加哥真是太走運了

95
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,940
Stupid,useless...
真是愚蠢又沒有用的…

96
00:06:18,170 --> 00:06:20,400
...Canadian money!
加拿大錢

97
00:06:25,810 --> 00:06:28,680
You have a very impressive resume, Miss Greene.
葛林小姐，你的履歷非常精彩

98
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:33,180
I especially like what I see about implementing a new filing system.
特別是我看到了這一段 「實施檔案管理系統」

99
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,320
Thank you.
謝謝

100
00:06:34,890 --> 00:06:39,020
Filing system? Those colored labels you put on all the folders?
「檔案管理系統」？ 你說資料夾上黏的彩色標籤啊

101
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:41,660
It did brighten up the filing cabinets.
那的確是讓檔案櫃生色不少

102
00:06:44,730 --> 00:06:46,830
They did more than that.
功能不只是那樣而已

103
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:52,100
I notice you've been entrusted with a lot of important responsibilities.
我看到你肩負了許多重要職責

104
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:56,670
Joanna really has been an incredible mentor to me.
對，喬安娜真是我的貴人

105
00:06:57,010 --> 00:06:59,950
Rachel has been incredible at getting my bagels.
瑞秋也是幫我買焙果的貴人

106
00:07:00,210 --> 00:07:02,840
She gets it right almost every time.
不可思議，她幾乎都不會買錯

107
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:07,350
Of course,I have more responsibilities than that.
我的職責當然不止那樣

108
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,390
Of course! There's the coffee too.
沒錯，還有咖啡也是

109
00:07:09,590 --> 00:07:13,050
Rachel can carry two things at once.
瑞秋一次能拎兩樣東西

110
00:07:14,130 --> 00:07:16,600
That's very good.
相當優秀

111
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,460
Now a big part of this job is...
這項工作的一大重點是

112
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:23,900
...cultivating personal relationships, especially with designers.
打好私人關係 尤其是和設計師

113
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:26,570
-Yes,l -She shouldn't have any problem.
對，我知道… 這一點瑞秋沒問題

114
00:07:26,770 --> 00:07:30,230
Her only problem might be getting too friendly,you know?
只怕她打得太火熱了吧？

115
00:07:31,650 --> 00:07:33,380
I love working with designers.
我最愛和設計師共事了

116
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:36,550
With them. Under them. What's the difference?
共事或共枕又有何差別呢？

117
00:07:42,590 --> 00:07:44,560
My first review is out.
我第一篇美食評論上報了

118
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:48,060
The Chelsea Reporter.
赤爾夕通訊報

119
00:07:48,260 --> 00:07:50,890
These used to keep me so warm.
以前我都拿這來當棉被蓋

120
00:07:51,730 --> 00:07:53,600
Look,I'm on the back page.
快看，我寫的刊在反面

121
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:58,300
"Would I go back to Allesandro's? Sure,I'd get two meals.
我會再光顧「亞歷山卓」嗎？ 當然，但我會點兩份餐

122
00:07:58,610 --> 00:08:02,130
One for me,and one for the guy pointing the gun to my head."
一份給自己 一份給拿槍抵著我的人

123
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:05,240
You really laid into this place.
你真把這家店批得一文不值

124
00:08:05,450 --> 00:08:08,440
They don't pay me a penny a word to make friends.
報社付我錢 可不是要我廣結善緣

125
00:08:08,650 --> 00:08:12,020
I found a guy who'd fix up the van for catering.
我得走了，我找到一個人 他能搞定那部外燴廂型車

126
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:13,240
You want me to go?
要我一起去嗎？

127
00:08:13,450 --> 00:08:16,620
It's okay. Are we sure we don't want the waterbed?
不用了，沒關係 但你確定我們不要那張水床？

128
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:23,530
Because it would be silly to take it out if we're just gonna put it back in again.
如果拿下來又要放回去 那不是很蠢嗎？

129
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,490
Haven't we made this decision?
我們不是早就說好了？

130
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:28,030
Yeah,all right.
對啦，算了

131
00:08:28,808 --> 00:08:30,571
再見 再見

132
00:08:36,540 --> 00:08:40,040
-Who is it? -It's Allesandro,from Allesandro's.
誰啊？ 我是亞歷山卓的老闆

133
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:46,550
-Oh,my God. -I want to talk to you about your review.
天啊 我要跟你討論美食評鑒的事

136
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:48,580
Call me on the phone.
你打電話給我

137
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:51,850
What? So you can hang up on me?
好讓你掛我電話？

138
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:55,020
I'll never let you up, so just go away.
我不會讓你上來的 你還是走吧

139
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:58,560
-Just give me a chance to -Do you need to get in?
給我一個機會… 你要進來嗎？請進

140
00:08:58,770 --> 00:09:00,260
No,Phoebe!
菲比，不行啦

141
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:01,900
Hey,Monica!
嗨，摩妮卡

142
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:12,750
I want a retraction. Our food is not "inedible swill."
我要你收回你的話 我們的食物絕非「難以下嚥」

143
00:09:12,950 --> 00:09:13,940
I couldn't eat it.
我就吃不下去

144
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:17,540
My five friends couldn't eat it, and one of them eats books.
我那五個朋友也難以下嚥 其中一個人連書都能吃了

145
00:09:18,950 --> 00:09:21,110
Our service isn't "grossly incompetent."
我們的服務 也不是賓至如「衰」

146
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:24,410
The waiter carried the breadsticks in his pants.
侍者把把麵包棒塞在褲子裡

147
00:09:25,730 --> 00:09:29,420
Well,you said that we accept the Discover Card...
你還寫說 我們店裡接受發現卡

148
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:32,060
...which we do not!
其實不行

149
00:09:32,530 --> 00:09:34,870
All right,that I'll retract.
好啊，那段話我可以收回

150
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:38,300
But I stand by my review. I know food,and that wasn't it.
但我捍衛我寫的評論 我懂美食，你們賣的差遠了

151
00:09:38,870 --> 00:09:40,900
Your marinara sauce tastes like tomato juice.
你們的大蒜番茄醬 簡直跟蕃茄汁沒兩樣

152
00:09:41,110 --> 00:09:43,580
You should serve it with vodka and celery.
應該要配伏特加 和芹菜莖一起上

153
00:09:44,250 --> 00:09:46,480
I'm proud of that sauce. It's delicious.
我很以店裡那醬汁為榮 可口極了

154
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:50,850
You own an ltalian restaurant, and you think that tastes good?
天啊，你是開意大利餐廳的 竟然覺得那樣叫做可口？

155
00:09:51,220 --> 00:09:52,310
Where are you from?
你到底是哪裡人？

156
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:55,320
Lebanon.
黎巴嫩

157
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,690
Hand me those tomatoes.
把那些蕃茄給我

158
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:01,360
I'll show you what it should taste like.
我來示範純正的味道是怎樣

160
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:06,900
How long will this take? I got another critic to yell at.
你要弄多久？ 我還要去罵另一個美食評論家

161
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:15,970
Joanna,I want to talk about that interview.
喬安娜，我要談談面試的事

162
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:18,440
I thought it went very well.
我覺得你在面試中表現得很棒

163
00:10:19,250 --> 00:10:23,310
No,it didn't. That's what I want to talk to you about.
不，才怪 我就是要跟你說這件事

164
00:10:24,950 --> 00:10:26,420
Now just to brief you...
我先聲明一句…

165
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:30,350
...I may cry.
我可能會哭出來

166
00:10:31,990 --> 00:10:35,760
But they are not tears of sadness or of anger...
但那不是悲傷或氣憤的淚水

167
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:38,430
...but just of us having this discussion.
只是因為我要你跟討論這件事

168
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:41,260
Please,don't make a scene.
麻煩你別丟人現眼了

169
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,100
There's nobody here.
這裡又沒人

170
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:46,270
Sophie,get in here.
蘇菲，你進來

171
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:50,770
See? You're making Sophie uncomfortable.
看吧，你讓蘇菲尷尬了

172
00:10:51,350 --> 00:10:52,870
No,she's not.
我沒有尷尬啊

173
00:10:53,110 --> 00:10:57,140
Congratulations. You crossed the line into completely useless. Get out.
恭喜，你剛證明了 自己一無用處，滾吧

174
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:02,220
Do you want me to quit?
你是要我辭職嗎？

175
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,820
What makes you think that?
你怎麼會這樣想？

176
00:11:04,890 --> 00:11:07,190
Those things you said in the interview...
因為你在面試時講的那些話

177
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:10,520
...if you believe them, I must not be a good assistant.
如果裡面有你的真心話 那我一定不是個好助理

178
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,790
You know what?
不如這樣吧

179
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:17,740
I am just going to pack up my desk...
我要來收拾辦公桌

180
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:22,870
...and I will be gone by the end of the day.
我等今天下班就走人

181
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,980
There's no use staying till the end of the day.
我想沒必要耗到今天下班了

182
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:31,720
Wait,wait.
你等等…

183
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:34,850
You can put your sad little muffin back.
把那可憐的鬆糕放回抽屜裡

184
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:40,130
If you must know the truth,I didn't want to lose a good assistant.
如果你要聽實話的話 是我不想失去你這完美的助理

185
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:41,680
What?
什麼？

186
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:46,490
That's why I said those things about your flirting and drinking.
所以我才瞎掰出那些招蜂引蝶 還有你酗酒的事

187
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:48,360
My drinking?
我酗酒？

188
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,400
I must have said that after you left.
我等你離開之後才說的

189
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:55,070
Said what,exactly?
你到底說了什麼？

190
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,940
You enjoy the occasional drink...
你三不五時喜歡喝一杯…

191
00:11:57,210 --> 00:11:58,580
...-ing binge.
酒後亂性

192
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:02,870
Oh,my God! That is it. I'm leaving!
天啊，真是夠了，我走人

193
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:05,020
You are just a horrible person!
你這個人真的很糟糕

194
00:12:05,250 --> 00:12:06,410
Wait,wait.
等等…

195
00:12:06,620 --> 00:12:09,520
If you're going to get all sensitive about it.
反應不用那麼激烈嘛

196
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,060
I don't want to lose you.
我不想失去你

197
00:12:11,260 --> 00:12:13,850
What if I create a position for you?
不如我變出個職位給你？

198
00:12:14,130 --> 00:12:17,030
I'll make you assistant buyer in this department.
我讓你在這個部門裡 擔任採購助理

199
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,370
Say more things like that.
你再多說一點

200
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:24,760
Your own office and a raise, effective tomorrow.
你有自己的辦公室 外帶加薪，明天就生效

201
00:12:25,540 --> 00:12:28,010
-I need an expense account. -Done!
我需要公關費 沒問題

202
00:12:28,610 --> 00:12:31,040
-And an assistant. -Sophie!
還要有助理 蘇菲，進來

203
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:41,080
Hey,I thought you'd be out partying with Gandol-...
你們怎麼在這裡 不是跟甘呆夫…

204
00:12:41,290 --> 00:12:42,310
...-dorf.
去狂歡了？

205
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:46,780
It's Gandalf,and he's not coming.
是甘道夫，他不來了

206
00:12:47,060 --> 00:12:48,890
You've been sitting here all day?
那你們一早都呆坐在這裡？

207
00:12:50,460 --> 00:12:52,490
I balanced my checkbook.
沒有，我剛剛把帳算好了

208
00:12:53,630 --> 00:12:56,900
And I gave first names to all the foosball players.
對，手足球檯裡的選手 我也全都取好了名字

209
00:12:58,670 --> 00:13:01,230
I can't believe he didn't come.
不敢相信甘道夫竟然沒來

210
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:04,600
So what? We can still go out and party ourselves.
他不來又怎樣？ 我們還是可以自己出去狂歡啊

211
00:13:04,910 --> 00:13:08,140
With Gandalf,we'd be out all night.
有甘道夫在，一整晚都有的玩

212
00:13:08,650 --> 00:13:12,920
We'd meet total strangers and hang out with them.
而且能和一堆陌生人一起混

213
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,520
We could do that.
我們也可以啊

214
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:18,150
There was other stuff too.
他還有其他的絕招啦

215
00:13:19,190 --> 00:13:20,920
We'll do it all and better!
我們一網打盡，更勝於藍

216
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:25,100
After tonight,Gandalf will want to party with us,dude!
兄弟，今晚過後 就換我們帶甘道夫去狂歡

217
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,100
It's not like we don't know how to party!
活像我們不會狂歡似的

218
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:31,600
All right! Let's go.
好，咱們走

219
00:13:31,810 --> 00:13:34,640
Maybe we could end up on a boat again?
最後再到一次船上如何？

220
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:35,970
All right!
好耶！

221
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:40,210
When were we on a boat?
上次在船上是何時？

222
00:13:40,510 --> 00:13:45,180
Remember that cold morning with those dogs licking your face?
記得那天早上很冷 一早醒來還有狗舔你的臉？

223
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:47,010
Those were seals,man.
記得 老兄，舔你的可是海豹呢

224
00:13:54,730 --> 00:13:57,790
How would this suit look on an assistant buyer
摩妮卡，快問快答 採購助理穿這套裝如何？

225
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,060
The owner of Allesandro's came to yell at me.
亞歷山卓的老闆上門來吼我

226
00:14:00,370 --> 00:14:03,830
But I made him sauce,and he offered me the job as head chef!
但我乘勢幫他做了醬料 結果他挖我去店裡做主廚

227
00:14:04,710 --> 00:14:08,870
You just ruined the thing I was practicing,but I'm so happy!
天啊，你毀了我練的好戲 但我真是替你高興

228
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:12,510
Can you believe it? I get to run my own kitchen!
你相信嗎？ 我終於可以在廚房當老大了

229
00:14:12,710 --> 00:14:14,540
Oh,you've waited so long.
你盼了那麼久

230
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,540
Pheebs! Quick question for you.
菲比，快問快答

231
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:20,720
How would this suit look...
布魯明戴爾的採購助理…

232
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:23,390
...on an assistant buyer at Bloomingdale's?
穿上這套裝如何？

233
00:14:23,590 --> 00:14:27,050
It would totally depend on her coloring and....
那完全要看她的膚色而定

234
00:14:27,860 --> 00:14:29,090
You got the job!
你拿到那工作了！

235
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,230
You got the job? Why didn't you tell me?
你被錄取了？怎麼沒跟我說？

236
00:14:34,900 --> 00:14:38,500
It'll be so great! I'll help decide what we sell.
一定超棒的 我能幫忙決定要賣什麼

237
00:14:38,710 --> 00:14:41,270
I'll have an office with walls and everything.
還有全套裝潢的私人辦公室

238
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:43,270
I'm going to have walls!
四面都有牆耶

239
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:47,880
Is this the day of good news or what? I got us a job.
今天真是好消息連連 我幫大家找到工作了

240
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:49,170
The wedding reception.
喜宴外燴

241
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:55,580
I kind of need to talk to you about that.
菲比，我有話要跟你說

242
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:03,890
I think it's time for me to take a step back from the catering.
我想外燴的事不能操之過急

243
00:15:04,130 --> 00:15:05,960
But we've only had one job.
但我們只做了一筆生意啊

244
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:11,700
But now we have this second one, and it feels like it's snowballing.
我知道，但現在有第二筆了 就像雪球越滾越大

245
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,410
What are you saying?
你在說什麼？

246
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:17,910
I got offered the head chef job at Allesandro's.
亞歷山卓餐廳請我去當主廚

247
00:15:19,110 --> 00:15:22,480
It's okay,because you don't really need me.
什麼？ 不礙事的，仔細想想 其實你也不需要我

249
00:15:23,050 --> 00:15:25,250
You're the cook!
廚師是你耶！

250
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:29,380
Without you,it's just me driving up to people's houses...
總不能我自己一個開去別人家

251
00:15:29,590 --> 00:15:31,460
...with empty trays, asking for money.
帶著空盤子就跟人要錢吧？

252
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:39,170
All right. But I'll pay you back all the money you invested.
好，我會還回所有你投資的錢

253
00:15:39,430 --> 00:15:42,560
-And you can keep the van! -For what?
那部廂型車歸你 我要拿來幹嘛？

255
00:15:44,170 --> 00:15:45,760
I can't believe this!
我真是不敢相信

256
00:15:46,070 --> 00:15:47,510
I got to get out of here.
我得離開這裡

257
00:15:47,810 --> 00:15:49,240
Phoebe,wait a minute.
菲比，你等等

258
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:54,840
I'm an assistant buyer!
我升採購助理了！

259
00:15:56,822 --> 00:16:00,019
（中央咖啡館）

260
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:03,250
We'll get coffee,get energized, then head back out.
我們先喝咖啡養足精神 再重新出動

261
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:05,220
-Yeah,all right. -Okay.
好吧 好

262
00:16:09,130 --> 00:16:10,790
So we're having fun,right?
很好玩嘛，對不對？

263
00:16:11,130 --> 00:16:13,120
We don't need that wizard guy.
我們才不需要那個什麼巫師的

264
00:16:13,370 --> 00:16:16,360
We hit some clubs, talk to some strangers...
我們去了幾家俱樂部 跟一些陌生人說過話

265
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:20,100
...then go down to the docks and see about that boat thing.
等一下去碼頭安排坐船的事

266
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,600
I'm kind of beat.
我有點累了

267
00:16:24,810 --> 00:16:25,870
Actually...
其實…

268
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:27,780
...me too.
我也是

269
00:16:28,380 --> 00:16:29,870
Are you serious?
你們是真的假的？ 真的

270
00:16:30,650 --> 00:16:32,350
Thank God! I'm exhausted.
感謝老天，我也累斃了

271
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:35,980
You guys want coffees?
你們要喝咖啡嗎？ 對

272
00:16:36,220 --> 00:16:39,390
I don't want to be up too late, so I'll have a decaf.
但我今天想早點睡 所以我要無咖啡因的

273
00:16:39,690 --> 00:16:41,130
Yeah,me too.
對，我也是

274
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:44,930
Actually,could I get some hot water with lemon?
我能來杯熱水加點萊姆汁嗎？

275
00:16:46,370 --> 00:16:50,830
I strained my voice screaming in there. Does it have to be so loud?
我剛才在那家店裡都喊到啞了 他們音樂非要開那麼大聲嗎？

276
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:55,070
I can't hear a word. My ears are ringing so bad.
我聽不到你說什麼 我耳鳴得厲害

277
00:16:55,310 --> 00:16:57,780
I was glad I had that extra pair of socks.
幸好我多帶了一雙襪子

278
00:16:57,980 --> 00:16:59,340
I used them as mittens.
拿來當手套用

279
00:16:59,550 --> 00:17:02,540
I didn't want to touch a thing in that last place.
最後那家店髒到我不敢用手碰

280
00:17:06,550 --> 00:17:08,420
How sad are we?
我們真是可悲到了極點

281
00:17:09,090 --> 00:17:10,390
Yeah,I know.
對，我知道

282
00:17:11,530 --> 00:17:13,360
You know what? We're not sad.
其實我們並不可悲

283
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:15,590
We're just not 21 anymore. You know?
只是我們都過了21歲

284
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:17,390
I'm 29 years old,damn it!
我都已經29歲了

285
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:20,190
I want to sit in a comfortable chair,watch TV...
只想舒服地坐著看電視

286
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:23,200
...and go to sleep at a reasonable hour.
時間到了就上床睡覺

287
00:17:23,900 --> 00:17:28,570
I like to hang out in a quiet place where I can talk to my friends.
我喜歡去安靜一點的地方 才能好好跟朋友聊天

288
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:33,610
And so what if I like to go home, put on Kenny G and take a bath?
就算回家聽肯尼吉的音樂洗澡 又有什麼大不了？

289
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:40,080
We're 29. We're not women.
我們是29歲沒錯 但我們可不是娘兒們

290
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:49,360
There you are.
你到了

291
00:17:50,260 --> 00:17:52,860
I'm glad you decided to hear me out.
我很高興你決定聽我解釋

292
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:54,760
Okay,I'm hearing.
好，你說吧

293
00:17:56,070 --> 00:17:58,200
I've been doing a lot of thinking.
我想了很多

294
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:03,470
I came up with a bunch of businesses that you can do with your van.
我想出了你用廂型車 可以做的所有生意

295
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:07,480
You could be a flower delivery person.
你可以去送花

296
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:11,080
-What? -Or a bakery delivery person?
什麼？ 或是送麵包？

298
00:18:12,450 --> 00:18:14,390
Pizza?
送比薩？

299
00:18:14,426 --> 00:18:15,916
摩妮卡？

300
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:18,920
I got a whole bunch of stuff in this area.
我寫了一堆你能運送的東西

301
00:18:19,130 --> 00:18:21,920
But I get the feeling you don't want to deliver.
但我有預感你不想送貨

302
00:18:23,030 --> 00:18:26,360
-No. -Okay.
對 那好吧

303
00:18:28,570 --> 00:18:30,590
I guess if you don't want to deliver...
我猜若你不想送貨的話…

304
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:33,670
...you probably don't want to pick up stuff either.
八成也不會想去載貨

305
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:35,700
No.
對

306
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:40,810
You know what?
不如這樣吧

307
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:42,940
Let's do the catering business.
我們來做外燴

308
00:18:43,150 --> 00:18:47,990
-Really? Are you sure? -Yeah,I made a commitment to you.
真的？你確定？ 對，我承諾過你

310
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:49,990
It'd be fun.
會很有趣的

311
00:18:50,260 --> 00:18:52,020
It will be fun!
一定會很有趣的

312
00:18:54,290 --> 00:18:57,200
Let's plan the wedding reception.
那我們來計劃喜宴的事

314
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:07,470
You really wanted me to do something with this van.
你還真的是很用心想了 讓我用這廂型車來做些事

315
00:19:11,310 --> 00:19:14,140
You know what? I want you to take the chef job.
不如這樣吧 我要你接下那主廚的工作

316
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:17,150
-Really? -Yeah.
真的？ 對

317
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:19,380
That's what you really want.
那是你真心想要做的

318
00:19:19,650 --> 00:19:23,710
I don't want to be the reason you're unhappy. I'd be unhappy.
我不想成為你不高興的原因 那樣我也會不高興

319
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:27,050
And I really don't want to be the reason I'm unhappy.
我更不想讓自己不高興

320
00:19:27,660 --> 00:19:28,990
Thank you.
謝謝你

321
00:19:31,870 --> 00:19:35,390
Besides,it might be kind of fun to form the new A-Team.
而且成立新的天龍特攻隊 應該會很好玩

322
00:19:44,340 --> 00:19:45,470
Hi,Mrs. Lynch.
林區太太

323
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:47,200
Is Joanna in already?
喬安娜進公司了嗎？

324
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:50,070
Oh,my goodness! You haven't heard.
老天，你還沒聽說

325
00:19:50,350 --> 00:19:52,980
-Heard what? -Joanna...
聽說什麼？ 喬安娜…

327
00:19:53,390 --> 00:19:55,080
...passed away last night.
昨晚過世了

328
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,990
Oh,my God! How?
天啊，怎麼會這樣？

329
00:19:58,190 --> 00:20:01,030
She was leaving work, and she was hit by a cab.
她下班出去時被計程車撞上

330
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:04,030
Oh,my God! I cannot believe it!
天啊，我不敢相信

331
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:05,660
I know.
我知道

332
00:20:05,870 --> 00:20:09,960
Oh,God. Oh,God.
天啊…

333
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:13,030
Oh,God.
天啊

334
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:16,100
I didn't realize that you were so close.
沒想到你們兩個這麼好

335
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:19,180
Yes. So close!
對，好到不行 （亦指：就差那麼一點點）

336
00:20:21,780 --> 00:20:26,910
I know that this is an emotional and difficult time for all of us.
林區太太，我知道這個節骨眼 大家在情緒上都很煎熬

337
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:30,290
But by any chance,did Joanna...
但在事發之前，喬安娜是不是…

338
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:33,430
...send any paperwork your way before...
...正好有把人事調動公文…

340
00:20:33,630 --> 00:20:37,060
-...it happened? -No,nothing.
..交給你？ 完全沒有

342
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:43,400
Imagine,if she'd just stepped off that curb a few seconds later.
只盼當初 她晚個幾秒鐘過街就沒事了

344
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:47,200
Yes,just a few seconds and she'd still be with us.
對，差個幾秒鐘 她就還能跟我們在一起

345
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:49,430
Nothing about an assistant buyer?
她沒說到採購助理的事？

346
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:52,640
I'm sorry. I have to go.
不好意思，我得走了

347
00:20:55,050 --> 00:20:56,040
Good morning!
早安

348
00:20:57,620 --> 00:20:59,280
I guess you didn't hear about Joanna.
蘇菲，我猜你還不知道 喬安娜的事

349
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:01,020
I sure did!
我當然知道

350
00:21:06,490 --> 00:21:09,490
I'm excited about having Monica on board with us.
我很興奮能請到摩妮卡加入

351
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:13,490
Although I do feel bad about having fired Chef Emilio.
雖然開除艾米裡歐主廚 讓我覺得很過意不去

352
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:16,360
It is like losing a member of the family.
那就像是失去了一個家人

353
00:21:16,670 --> 00:21:20,730
Of course,that literally is the case for several of you.
不過對你們其中幾位而言 真的是失去家人

354
00:21:22,380 --> 00:21:25,040
Tony,Carlos,Marie...
東尼、卡洛斯、瑪莉…

355
00:21:25,280 --> 00:21:29,270
...please tell your father how much we're going to miss him.
請向令尊轉達 我們會有多想念艾米裡歐

356
00:21:30,620 --> 00:21:34,780
I know Monica has a lot of great ideas for this place.
我知道摩妮卡對這家店 有許多很棒的點子

357
00:21:35,020 --> 00:21:38,050
Well,you all read the review.
你們都看過她那篇評論了

358
00:21:38,290 --> 00:21:40,620
So without much further ado...
所以廢話不多說

359
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:44,790
...I present to you our new head chef.
在此向各位介紹本店的新主廚

360
00:21:51,070 --> 00:21:55,630
I just want to say that with a pinch of excitement...
我只想說只要有熱忱

361
00:21:55,910 --> 00:21:59,210
...a dash of hard work and a dollop of cooperation...
肯吃苦，肯合作

362
00:21:59,410 --> 00:22:01,380
...we can have the recipe....
我們就能將本店的菜色…

363
00:22:05,850 --> 00:22:08,010
Are you going to kill me?
你們打算殺我滅口？

364
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


365
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
